            "body": "Mr. Kapoor apni bhanji Tanishka ko metro se naani ke ghar le ja rahe the. Dono train ke ek dibbe mein khidki ke paas baithe the. Tanishka ke bagal wali seat par ek aur yatri baithe the.\n\nTrain abhi platform par khadi thi. Tanishka khidki se platform ke khambhe aur chai ke stall ko dekh rahi thi. Phir ek halki si ghanti bajee aur train chal padi.\n\nTanishka ek dum bol padi, \"Mama, dekhiye! Platform peeche ki taraf bhaag raha hai!\"\n\nMr. Kapoor muskuraye. \"Platform to apni jagah par hai, beta. Train aage chal rahi hai.\"\n\nTanishka ne sir hilaya, par phir uski nazar apne bagal wale yatri par gayi. \"Mama, ek aur baat. Ye uncle to bilkul ruke hue lag rahe hain. Na aage jaa rahe, na peeche. Lekin agar train chal rahi hai, to wo bhi to chal rahe honge na?\"\n\nMr. Kapoor ne kaha, \"Bahut accha sawaal hai. Platform par khade guard se poochho to wo kahega ki tum, main aur ye uncle teeno tez chal rahe hain. Tumhe lagta hai ki uncle ruke hain. Ab bolo, **sach kya hai?** Uncle chal rahe hain ya ruke hain?\"\n\nTanishka confuse ho gayi. Is kahani ko hum topic ke end mein poora solve karenge. Pehle \"chalna\" aur \"ruka hona\" ka asli matlab samajhte hain.",
