            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Ab tak humne jitni bhi motion dekhi, wo ek seedhi line mein thi: gaadi sadak par seedhi chali, gend seedhi gir gayi. Pichle topic mein humne uniform acceleration ke teen equations (v = u + at, s = ut + ½at², v² = u² + 2as) seekhe, aur wo sab seedhi line ke liye the. Par duniya mein bahut kuch seedha nahi chalta: pankha ghoomta hai, ghadi ki sui ghoomti hai, giant wheel ghoomta hai.\n\nIs aakhri topic mein hum dekhenge ki jab cheez **gol ghumti hai** to kya alag hota hai. Sabse majedaar baat ye hai ki speed same rehne par bhi motion \"accelerated\" ho sakti hai. Ye chapter ka aakhri topic hai, to end mein poore chapter ka wrap-up bhi hoga.",
