            "heading": "Kumhaar ka chaak aur rang-birangi mitti",
            "headingHinglish": "Kumhaar ka chaak aur rang-birangi mitti",
            "body": "Mr. Prajapati kumhaar hain. Unke chaak (potter's wheel) par mitti ka ek gola ghoom raha hai, aur wo us par ek sundar sa diya bana rahe hain. Bachhi Diya paas baithkar dekh rahi hai.\n\nDiya ko ek shararat soojhti hai. Wo laal rang ki mitti ki ek chhoti si boond chaak ke kinare ke paas laga deti hai. Chaak ghoomta hai, aur laal boond bhi ghoomti hai: round and round, round and round.\n\n\"Mr. Prajapati, dekhiye! Ye boond hamesha same raftaar se ghoom rahi hai. Par ye to ek second bhi seedhi nahi chalti. Har pal uski disha badal jaati hai: kabhi aage, kabhi daayein, kabhi peeche, kabhi baayein!\"\n\nMr. Prajapati muskurate hain. \"Bilkul sahi dekha, beta. Aur agar ye boond chaak se chhoot jaaye, to kahan jaayegi, pata hai? Ghumte-ghumte gol nahi jaayegi. Seedhi ud jaayegi, us disha mein jis disha mein us waqt wo ja rahi thi.\"\n\n\"Kis disha mein?\" Diya poochti hai. Chalo, ye dono sawaal hum aage hal karte hain.",
