            "body": "Gaon ki ek gali thi, aur gali ke beech ek halka sa dhalaan (slope) tha. Dhalaan ke neeche sabziyon se bhara ek **haath-thela** (handcart) khada tha: tamatar, lauki, aloo, gobhi. Thele ke maalik **Mr. Hegde** ko us dhalaan ke upar bazaar tak pahunchna tha.\n\nMr. Hegde ne thele ke peeche haath rakhe aur poori taaqat se **dhakka** diya. Thela ek inch bhi nahi hila. Unhone phir se zor lagaya. Kuch nahi.\n\nTabhi school se lautti **Trisha** wahan se guzri. Usne bag neeche rakha aur boli, \"Uncle, main bhi lagati hoon!\" Dono ne milkar dhakka diya. Thele ke pahiye zara sa kasmasaye, par thela ab bhi wahin ka wahin.\n\nItne mein gali ke teen log aur aa gaye. Ab paanchon ne ek saath dhakka lagaya. Pehle thela **hila**, phir **sarakne laga**, phir uski speed **badhti gayi**, aur dekhte hi dekhte wo dhalaan par **upar chadhne laga**.\n\nTrisha hanspadi, \"Uncle, pehle kuch hua hi nahi, ab achanak chal pada! Ye dhakke ka kya chakkar hai?\" Is kahani ko hum topic ke ant mein number aur arrows ke saath solve karenge.",
