            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Friction (gharshan)** | Wo force jo do chhoote hue surfaces ke beech unki relative motion (ek-doosre par sarakne) ya sarakne ki koshish ko rokta hai | Almirah ko dhakelne par zameen ka rokna |\n| **Static friction** | Cheez ke chalna shuru karne se **pehle** lagne wala friction | Bhaari almirah dhakela par hila nahi |\n| **Sliding friction** | Cheez ke surface par **sarakte** hue lagne wala friction | Almirah sarak raha hai |\n| **Rolling friction** | Cheez ke **ludhakte** (roll hote) hue lagne wala friction, sabse kam | Rollers ya pahiye |\n| **Limiting (maximum) static friction** | Static friction ki sabse badi value: isse zyada push par cheez chal padti hai | 30 N |\n| **Lubricant** | Wo chikni cheez (tel, grease) jo friction kam karti hai | Cycle chain mein tel |\n| **Fluid friction / drag** | Hawa ya paani jaise fluid ka rokna | Hawa mein girta parachute |\n| **Necessary evil** | Aisi cheez jo nuksaan bhi karti hai aur zaroori bhi hai | Friction |",
