            "bodyHinglish": "Pichhle topic mein humne momentum **p = m v** padha, aur ek dilchasp baat dekhi thi: jis cheez ka momentum zyada ho, use rokne ya uska momentum badalne ke liye **ya to bada force chahiye, ya zyada time**. Wo baat abhi sirf \"feel\" thi. Is topic mein hum use **ek seedhe formula** mein badal denge, jisse bata sakte hain ki kitna force lagane par kisi cheez ki velocity kitni tezi se badlegi. Isi formula ko **Newton ka Doosra Law** kehte hain."
