            "heading": "Naye shabd",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Gravitational force (gravity)** | Do cheezon ke beech ek dusre ko kheenchne wala force, jo unki mass ki wajah se hota hai | Dharti ka aam ko kheenchna |\n| **Attractive force** | Wo force jo cheezon ko paas laane ki koshish kare | Gravity |\n| **Repulsive force** | Wo force jo cheezon ko door dhakele | Do same magnetic poles ka ek dusre ko dhakelna |\n| **Non-contact force** | Wo force jo bina chhue, door se lagta hai | Gravity, magnet ka kheenchna |\n| **Mass** | Cheez mein kitna padarth (matter) hai, kg mein naapa jata hai | Aam ki mass 0.4 kg |\n| **Kendra (centre)** | Dharti ke bilkul beech ka point | Gravity ka kheenchav isi ki taraf hota hai |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Gravitational force (gravity)** | Do cheezon ke beech ek dusre ko kheenchne wala force, jo unki mass ki wajah se hota hai | Dharti ka aam ko kheenchna |\n| **Attractive force** | Wo force jo cheezon ko paas laane ki koshish kare | Gravity |\n| **Repulsive force** | Wo force jo cheezon ko door dhakele | Do same magnetic poles ka ek dusre ko dhakelna |\n| **Non-contact force** | Wo force jo bina chhue, door se lagta hai | Gravity, magnet ka kheenchna |\n| **Mass** | Cheez mein kitna padarth (matter) hai, kg mein naapa jata hai | Aam ki mass 0.4 kg |\n| **Kendra (centre)** | Dharti ke bilkul beech ka point | Gravity ka kheenchav isi ki taraf hota hai |"
