            "body": "Pichhle topic mein humne seekha ki gravity ek **attractive force** hai jo **koi bhi do cheezon ke beech** lagta hai jinme mass hai, aur Earth hamein apne **centre** ki taraf kheenchti hai. Humne ye bhi dekha ki chhoti cheezon ke beech ye force bahut hi **tiny** hota hai. Ab sawal hai: **kitna** tiny? Aur ye force kin cheezon par nirbhar karta hai: mass par, doori par, ya dono par? Newton ne iska ek seedha formula diya, jise **Universal Law of Gravitation** kehte hain. Aaj hum use samjhenge aur khud number nikalenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pichhle topic mein humne seekha ki gravity ek **attractive force** hai jo **koi bhi do cheezon ke beech** lagta hai jinme mass hai, aur Earth hamein apne **centre** ki taraf kheenchti hai. Humne ye bhi dekha ki chhoti cheezon ke beech ye force bahut hi **tiny** hota hai. Ab sawal hai: **kitna** tiny? Aur ye force kin cheezon par nirbhar karta hai: mass par, doori par, ya dono par? Newton ne iska ek seedha formula diya, jise **Universal Law of Gravitation** kehte hain. Aaj hum use samjhenge aur khud number nikalenge."
