            "headingHinglish": "Science fair mein do bhaari gendein",
            "body": "School ke science fair mein physics ki teacher Ms. Bose aur unka student Parth ek model dikha rahe the. Do bhaari, seese (lead) jaisi gendein, har ek **10 kg** ki, ek-doosre ke paas patli dori se latak rahi thi. Dono ke **centre** ke beech doori sirf **0.2 m** thi.\n\nParth ne aane-jaane walon se kaha, \"Newton ke hisaab se ye dono gendein ek-doosre ko **kheench** rahi hain.\"\n\nEk bachhe ne gaur se dekha aur bola, \"Par ye to bilkul hil hi nahi rahi!\"\n\nMs. Bose muskuraayin, \"Haan, kyunki ye force itna **chhota** hai ki naap-ne ke liye bahut sensitive machine chahiye. Aankhon se kuch nahi dikhega.\"\n\nTab Parth ne apni sabse zaroori baat poochhi, \"Madam, agar do bhaari gendein bhi ek-doosre ko mushkil se kheench paati hain, to **Earth hamein itni zor se kyun kheenchti hai** ki hum udte nahi, seedhe neeche aate hain?\"\n\nMs. Bose ne kaha, \"Bahut accha sawal, Parth. Iska jawab Newton ke formula mein chhupa hai. Is kahani ko hum topic ke beech mein number ke saath solve karenge.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "School ke science fair mein physics ki teacher Ms. Bose aur unka student Parth ek model dikha rahe the. Do bhaari, seese (lead) jaisi gendein, har ek **10 kg** ki, ek-doosre ke paas patli dori se latak rahi thi. Dono ke **centre** ke beech doori sirf **0.2 m** thi.\n\nParth ne aane-jaane walon se kaha, \"Newton ke hisaab se ye dono gendein ek-doosre ko **kheench** rahi hain.\"\n\nEk bachhe ne gaur se dekha aur bola, \"Par ye to bilkul hil hi nahi rahi!\"\n\nMs. Bose muskuraayin, \"Haan, kyunki ye force itna **chhota** hai ki naap-ne ke liye bahut sensitive machine chahiye. Aankhon se kuch nahi dikhega.\"\n\nTab Parth ne apni sabse zaroori baat poochhi, \"Madam, agar do bhaari gendein bhi ek-doosre ko mushkil se kheench paati hain, to **Earth hamein itni zor se kyun kheenchti hai** ki hum udte nahi, seedhe neeche aate hain?\"\n\nMs. Bose ne kaha, \"Bahut accha sawal, Parth. Iska jawab Newton ke formula mein chhupa hai. Is kahani ko hum topic ke beech mein number ke saath solve karenge.\""
