            "body": "Anaya chhutti mein apne ghar ki kitchen mein baithi thi. Cook Mr. Hussain salad bana rahe the. Unhone ek **tez dhaar wala chaaku** liya aur tamatar par halka sa dabaya: tamatar \"khach\" se do tukde ho gaya, bina zor lagaye.\n\nPhir unhone ek **kund (blunt) chaaku** uthaya. Is baar unhe kaafi zor se dabana pada, aur phir bhi tamatar kata nahi, bas **pichak** kar ras nikal aaya.\n\nAnaya ne hairaan hokar poochha, \"Hussain uncle, dono baar aapne haath se dhakka to lagbhag ek-sa hi diya, phir ek chaaku se tamatar kat gaya aur doosre se pichak gaya. Aisa kyun?\"\n\nMr. Hussain muskuraye, \"Dhakka (force) ek-sa ho sakta hai, beta, par asli khel is baat ka hai ki wo dhakka **kitni chhoti jagah** par laga hai. Chalo, iska hisaab hum topic ke beech mein number ke saath karte hain.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Anaya chhutti mein apne ghar ki kitchen mein baithi thi. Cook Mr. Hussain salad bana rahe the. Unhone ek **tez dhaar wala chaaku** liya aur tamatar par halka sa dabaya: tamatar \"khach\" se do tukde ho gaya, bina zor lagaye.\n\nPhir unhone ek **kund (blunt) chaaku** uthaya. Is baar unhe kaafi zor se dabana pada, aur phir bhi tamatar kata nahi, bas **pichak** kar ras nikal aaya.\n\nAnaya ne hairaan hokar poochha, \"Hussain uncle, dono baar aapne haath se dhakka to lagbhag ek-sa hi diya, phir ek chaaku se tamatar kat gaya aur doosre se pichak gaya. Aisa kyun?\"\n\nMr. Hussain muskuraye, \"Dhakka (force) ek-sa ho sakta hai, beta, par asli khel is baat ka hai ki wo dhakka **kitni chhoti jagah** par laga hai. Chalo, iska hisaab hum topic ke beech mein number ke saath karte hain.\""
