            "headingHinglish": "Aam galtiyan (bachke rehna)",
            "body": "**Galti 1: \"Sucking\" se kheench (pull) lagta hai.**\nStraw se peete waqt hum juice ko kheenchte nahi. Hum sirf munh ke andar pressure kam karte hain, aur bahar ka atmospheric pressure juice ko upar **dhakelta** hai. Pull nahi, push.\n\n**Galti 2: Atmosphere sirf neeche ki taraf dabaata hai.**\nNahi. Pressure har taraf lagta hai: upar, neeche, aage, peeche. Ulte glass ke card ko hawa **upar** ki taraf dhakel rahi thi.\n\n**Galti 3: Barometer ki oonchai nali ki chaudai ya tirchhapan par nirbhar hai.**\nNahi. Sirf **vertical oonchai** matter karti hai. Moti nali ho, patli ho, ya tirchhi ho, trough ki sataha se oonchai wahi 76 cm hogi.\n\n**Galti 4: 760 mm ko 76 m samajh lena.**\n760 mm = 76 cm = 0.76 m, **76 m nahi**. 1 m = 1000 mm, to 760 mm = 0.76 m. Units hamesha badlo pehle: P = 0.76 m × 13600 × 9.8, aur 76 × 13600 × 9.8 nahi.\n\n**Galti 5: Hawa mein wazan nahi hota.**\nHota hai. Ek kamre ki hawa ka wazan bhi kai kilogram hota hai. Atmospheric pressure isi hawa ke wazan se aata hai.\n\n**Galti 6: Ek hi sawaal mein g = 9.8 aur g = 10 dono lena.**\nEk value chuno aur poore sawaal mein wahi use karo. Is topic mein g = 9.8 m/s².\n\n**Galti 7: Table toot jaani chahiye kyunki 20000 N lag raha hai.**\nTable ke neeche se bhi utna hi pressure upar ki taraf lagta hai. Net bal 0 N hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "**Galti 1: \"Sucking\" se kheench (pull) lagta hai.**\nStraw se peete waqt hum juice ko kheenchte nahi. Hum sirf munh ke andar pressure kam karte hain, aur bahar ka atmospheric pressure juice ko upar **dhakelta** hai. Pull nahi, push.\n\n**Galti 2: Atmosphere sirf neeche ki taraf dabaata hai.**\nNahi. Pressure har taraf lagta hai: upar, neeche, aage, peeche. Ulte glass ke card ko hawa **upar** ki taraf dhakel rahi thi.\n\n**Galti 3: Barometer ki oonchai nali ki chaudai ya tirchhapan par nirbhar hai.**\nNahi. Sirf **vertical oonchai** matter karti hai. Moti nali ho, patli ho, ya tirchhi ho, trough ki sataha se oonchai wahi 76 cm hogi.\n\n**Galti 4: 760 mm ko 76 m samajh lena.**\n760 mm = 76 cm = 0.76 m, **76 m nahi**. 1 m = 1000 mm, to 760 mm = 0.76 m. Units hamesha badlo pehle: P = 0.76 m × 13600 × 9.8, aur 76 × 13600 × 9.8 nahi.\n\n**Galti 5: Hawa mein wazan nahi hota.**\nHota hai. Ek kamre ki hawa ka wazan bhi kai kilogram hota hai. Atmospheric pressure isi hawa ke wazan se aata hai.\n\n**Galti 6: Ek hi sawaal mein g = 9.8 aur g = 10 dono lena.**\nEk value chuno aur poore sawaal mein wahi use karo. Is topic mein g = 9.8 m/s².\n\n**Galti 7: Table toot jaani chahiye kyunki 20000 N lag raha hai.**\nTable ke neeche se bhi utna hi pressure upar ki taraf lagta hai. Net bal 0 N hai."
