            "body": "Pichhle topic mein humne seekha ki physics mein **work** tab hota hai jab (1) cheez par koi **force** lage aur (2) cheez **displace** ho, wo bhi force ki disha mein. Tab **W = F × s**, jahan F newton (N) mein, s metre (m) mein, aur W **joule (J)** mein. Wahan humne force aur displacement ko ek hi line mein, ek hi taraf liya tha. Ab sawal ye hai: agar force displacement ki **ulti** taraf ho? Ya **aade (tirchhe 90° par)** ho? Kya tab bhi work hoga? Aur uska sign kya hoga? Is topic mein yehi dekhenge.\n\n**Is poore topic mein g = 10 m/s² liya gaya hai**, to 1 kg ka weight (gravity ka force) 10 N hota hai.",
