            "body": "Shaam ko achanak bijli chali gayi. Mr. Bansal ke ghar mein andhera ho gaya. Unki beti Hiya ne kaha, \"Papa, kuch dikh nahi raha!\"\n\nMr. Bansal ne mez se ek **mombatti** nikali aur jala di. Kamre mein peeli roshni phail gayi. Phir unhone ek **battery wali torch** on ki, aur uski safed kiran deewar par chamak gayi. Ab raat ka khana banana tha, to unhone **gas stove** jalaya aur uski neeli lau par patila rakh diya.\n\nHiya sab dekh rahi thi. Wo boli, \"Papa, mombatti roshni aur garmi de rahi hai, torch roshni de rahi hai, aur stove garmi de raha hai. Ye teeno kuch na kuch **kar** rahe hain. Par inme **kya kharch ho raha hai?** Mombatti chhoti hoti ja rahi hai, torch ki battery kuch dino mein khatam ho jaati hai, aur cylinder bhi ek din khali ho jaata hai!\"\n\nMr. Bansal muskuraye, \"Bahut achha sawal hai Hiya. Is sawal ka jawab hai **energy**. Chalo, topic ke ant mein hum teeno ka jawab number ke saath nikalenge.\"",
