            "heading": "Aam galtiyan (bachke rehna)",
            "headingHinglish": "Aam galtiyan (bachke rehna)",
            "body": "1. **\"Energy ek force hai ya koi cheez hai.\"**\n   Galat. Energy kshamta hai, force nahi. Force newton (N) mein, energy joule (J) mein napi jaati hai.\n\n2. **\"Energy 'kharch' ho kar khatam ho jaati hai.\"**\n   Aam bolchaal mein hum kehte hain \"bijli kharch hui\", par asal mein energy sirf **roop badalti hai**. Mombatti ki chemical energy gayab nahi hui, wo heat aur light ban gayi. (Topic 6 mein poora.)\n\n3. **Heat aur temperature ko ek samajhna.**\n   Dono alag hain. Heat energy hai, temperature batata hai ki cheez kitni garam hai. Dono ka antar aage ki class mein.\n\n4. **\"Light aur sound energy nahi hain.\"**\n   Galat. Dono energy ke roop hain: dhoop se kapde sookhte hain, tez aawaz se sheeshe kaanp jaate hain.\n\n5. **\"Energy ka unit watt hai.\"**\n   Galat. Energy ka SI unit **joule (J)** hai. Watt (W) alag cheez hai: wo power ka unit hai (Topic 7).\n   Jaanch: 60 W pankha 10 s mein 600 **J** energy use karta hai: energy joule mein, power watt mein ✅.",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **\"Energy ek force hai ya koi cheez hai.\"**\n   Galat. Energy kshamta hai, force nahi. Force newton (N) mein, energy joule (J) mein napi jaati hai.\n\n2. **\"Energy 'kharch' ho kar khatam ho jaati hai.\"**\n   Aam bolchaal mein hum kehte hain \"bijli kharch hui\", par asal mein energy sirf **roop badalti hai**. Mombatti ki chemical energy gayab nahi hui, wo heat aur light ban gayi. (Topic 6 mein poora.)\n\n3. **Heat aur temperature ko ek samajhna.**\n   Dono alag hain. Heat energy hai, temperature batata hai ki cheez kitni garam hai. Dono ka antar aage ki class mein.\n\n4. **\"Light aur sound energy nahi hain.\"**\n   Galat. Dono energy ke roop hain: dhoop se kapde sookhte hain, tez aawaz se sheeshe kaanp jaate hain.\n\n5. **\"Energy ka unit watt hai.\"**\n   Galat. Energy ka SI unit **joule (J)** hai. Watt (W) alag cheez hai: wo power ka unit hai (Topic 7).\n   Jaanch: 60 W pankha 10 s mein 600 **J** energy use karta hai: energy joule mein, power watt mein ✅."
