            "headingHinglish": "Mr. Sathe ka toolbox",
            "body": "Mr. Sathe ek handyman hain: kisi ke ghar mein nal ka kaam, kisi ka darwaza theek karna. Aaj wo Dhara ke ghar aaye the. Kaam khatam hone par unhone apna purana toolbox khola aur ek-ek karke cheezein zameen par rakhi: ek **bottle opener**, ek **chimta (tongs)**, ek **nutcracker (akhrot-supaari todne wala)**, ek **screwdriver**, aur ek chhoti si **ramp** (lakdi ka dhalaan), jise wo bhaari drum ko truck mein ludhkaane ke liye istemaal karte hain.\n\nDhara Class 9 mein padhti hai. Usne sab cheezein dekhin aur boli, \"Mr. Sathe, ye sab **machine** hain? Machine to **bijli se chalti hai na**? Jaise mixer ya washing machine!\"\n\nMr. Sathe hans pade. \"Arre Dhara, bijli to bas ek tarika hai. Machine ka matlab hai: **koi bhi aisi cheez jo kaam ko aasaan bana de.** Bottle opener ka dhakkan kholna dekho. Haath se kholne ki koshish karo to ungli kat jaati hai. Opener se ek halka jhatka aur dhakkan khul gaya. Bina bijli ke, bina petrol ke. Chalo, main tumhein dikhata hoon ki ye paanchon cheezein kaise kaam aasaan karti hain.\" Is kahani ko hum topic ke end mein solve karenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Sathe ek handyman hain: kisi ke ghar mein nal ka kaam, kisi ka darwaza theek karna. Aaj wo Dhara ke ghar aaye the. Kaam khatam hone par unhone apna purana toolbox khola aur ek-ek karke cheezein zameen par rakhi: ek **bottle opener**, ek **chimta (tongs)**, ek **nutcracker (akhrot-supaari todne wala)**, ek **screwdriver**, aur ek chhoti si **ramp** (lakdi ka dhalaan), jise wo bhaari drum ko truck mein ludhkaane ke liye istemaal karte hain.\n\nDhara Class 9 mein padhti hai. Usne sab cheezein dekhin aur boli, \"Mr. Sathe, ye sab **machine** hain? Machine to **bijli se chalti hai na**? Jaise mixer ya washing machine!\"\n\nMr. Sathe hans pade. \"Arre Dhara, bijli to bas ek tarika hai. Machine ka matlab hai: **koi bhi aisi cheez jo kaam ko aasaan bana de.** Bottle opener ka dhakkan kholna dekho. Haath se kholne ki koshish karo to ungli kat jaati hai. Opener se ek halka jhatka aur dhakkan khul gaya. Bina bijli ke, bina petrol ke. Chalo, main tumhein dikhata hoon ki ye paanchon cheezein kaise kaam aasaan karti hain.\" Is kahani ko hum topic ke end mein solve karenge."
