            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Pichhle topic mein humne lever dekha: ek **bar** aur ek **pivot (fulcrum)**. Bar ko pivot ke upar ghumaya aur chhota effort lagakar bhaari load utha liya. Ab ek bilkul alag shakal ki machine dekhte hain: bar aur pivot ki jagah ek **pahiya (wheel)** aur ek **rassi (rope)**. Is machine ka naam hai **pulley**. Ye kuein se paani kheenchne se lekar bade cranes tak har jagah milti hai. Topic 2 ke teen shabd (MA, VR aur efficiency) yahan bhi wahi kaam karenge, to unhe ek baar yaad kar lena.\n\n**Is poore topic mein g = 10 m/s² liya gaya hai**, to 1 kg ka weight 10 N hota hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pichhle topic mein humne lever dekha: ek **bar** aur ek **pivot (fulcrum)**. Bar ko pivot ke upar ghumaya aur chhota effort lagakar bhaari load utha liya. Ab ek bilkul alag shakal ki machine dekhte hain: bar aur pivot ki jagah ek **pahiya (wheel)** aur ek **rassi (rope)**. Is machine ka naam hai **pulley**. Ye kuein se paani kheenchne se lekar bade cranes tak har jagah milti hai. Topic 2 ke teen shabd (MA, VR aur efficiency) yahan bhi wahi kaam karenge, to unhe ek baar yaad kar lena.\n\n**Is poore topic mein g = 10 m/s² liya gaya hai**, to 1 kg ka weight 10 N hota hai."
