            "heading": "Aam galtiyan (bachke rehna)",
            "headingHinglish": "Aam galtiyan (bachke rehna)",
            "body": "**1. Angle boundary (surface) se naap lena**\nSawal mein \"ray surface ke saath 30° ka angle banati hai\" ho to i = 30° likh dena galat hai.\n❌ i = 30°. ✅ i = 90° − 30° = 60°. i aur r hamesha **normal se** naape jaate hain.\n\n**2. Ye maanna ki ray har case mein normal ki taraf mudti hai**\nSirf **denser medium mein jaate waqt** (rarer se denser) ray normal ki taraf mudti hai. **Denser se rarer** mein ray normal se **door** mudti hai.\n\n**3. Optical density ko mass density samajhna**\nKerosene paani se halka hai, phir bhi optically paani se **denser** hai. Optical density ka matlab hai ki medium light ko kitna dheema karta hai.\n\n**4. Ye samajhna ki normal par aane wali ray bhi mudti hai**\nJab i = 0° ho, r = 0° hota hai: ray seedhi nikal jaati hai. Raftaar badalti hai, direction nahi.\n\n**5. Ye maanna ki naye medium mein light ka rang (frequency) badal jaata hai**\nNaye medium mein light ka sirf **raftaar** (aur tirchi hone par direction) badalti hai, rang wahi rehta hai. (Idea.)\n\n**6. Reflected ray aur refracted ray mein confuse hona**\nReflected ray **usi medium mein wapas** aati hai. Refracted ray **doosre medium ke andar** jaati hai. Sketch mein ye dekho ki ray boundary ke kis taraf hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "**1. Angle boundary (surface) se naap lena**\nSawal mein \"ray surface ke saath 30° ka angle banati hai\" ho to i = 30° likh dena galat hai.\n❌ i = 30°. ✅ i = 90° − 30° = 60°. i aur r hamesha **normal se** naape jaate hain.\n\n**2. Ye maanna ki ray har case mein normal ki taraf mudti hai**\nSirf **denser medium mein jaate waqt** (rarer se denser) ray normal ki taraf mudti hai. **Denser se rarer** mein ray normal se **door** mudti hai.\n\n**3. Optical density ko mass density samajhna**\nKerosene paani se halka hai, phir bhi optically paani se **denser** hai. Optical density ka matlab hai ki medium light ko kitna dheema karta hai.\n\n**4. Ye samajhna ki normal par aane wali ray bhi mudti hai**\nJab i = 0° ho, r = 0° hota hai: ray seedhi nikal jaati hai. Raftaar badalti hai, direction nahi.\n\n**5. Ye maanna ki naye medium mein light ka rang (frequency) badal jaata hai**\nNaye medium mein light ka sirf **raftaar** (aur tirchi hone par direction) badalti hai, rang wahi rehta hai. (Idea.)\n\n**6. Reflected ray aur refracted ray mein confuse hona**\nReflected ray **usi medium mein wapas** aati hai. Refracted ray **doosre medium ke andar** jaati hai. Sketch mein ye dekho ki ray boundary ke kis taraf hai."
