            "body": "Pichhle topic mein humne light ki raftaar se refractive index nikaala: **n = c/v**. Humne ye bhi dekha ki do medium ke beech i aur r ka rishta **n = sin i / sin r** hai, yaani Snell ka niyam. Ab tak hum ek hi surface par refraction dekh rahe the: hawa se paani, ya hawa se glass. Par asli zindagi mein light aksar **dono taraf** se guzarti hai: pehle ek surface se andar jaati hai, phir doosre surface se bahar nikalti hai. Khidki ka sheesha, glass ka gilaas, aquarium, kaanch ki plate: sab aisi hi cheezein hain. Is topic mein hum dekhenge ki glass ke ek **block** (slab) se guzarne ke baad light ke saath kya hota hai, aur paani ya glass ke andar rakhi cheezein apni asli jagah se **upar uthi hui** kyun dikhti hain.",
