            "body": "Pichhle topic mein humne ek baat note ki thi: magnet ka force **door se** bhi kaam karta hai. Kaagaz ke upar rakhe paper clip ko neeche ke magnet se, chhue bina, khinchte dekha tha. Par ye \"door se\" asal mein kitni door tak? Magnet ke ek taraf kitna, doosri taraf kitna? Kya is asar ko hum **dekh** sakte hain, ya kam se kam **naksha (map)** bana sakte hain? Is topic mein hum magnet ke aas-paas ke us ilaake ko ek naam denge, usse ek naksha banayenge, aur phir dekhenge ki ye naksha ek **compass** ke baare mein aur poori **Prithvi (Earth)** ke baare mein kya batata hai.",
