            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Magnetic field** | Magnet ke aas-paas ka wo ilaaka jahan uska magnetic force mehsoos hota hai | Magnet ke paas rakhi lohe ki pin ko khinchne wala ilaaka |\n| **Field line (force ki line)** | Kalpanik (imaginary) line jo field ki disha aur taakat dikhati hai | Iron filings ke patterns jaisi curved lines |\n| **Iron filings** | Lohe ka bahut baareek burada | Lohe ko ragadne par jhadne wala churan |\n| **Tangent** | Kisi curve ko ek bindu (point) par sirf chhookar nikalne wali seedhi line | Cycle ke gol pahiye ko zameen sirf ek jagah chhoti hai |\n| **Compass** | Chhoti magnetised needle wala yantra jo disha (direction) batata hai | Jahaaz, trekking aur plane mein lagne wala compass |\n| **Geographic north** | Prithvi ke ghoomne wale axis ka north, jahan map ka north pole hai | Map par sabse upar wala bindu |\n| **Magnetic poles of Earth** | Prithvi ke magnetic field ke do pole, jo geographic poles ke paas (par bilkul wahan nahi) hain | Compass ka N end isi ki taraf jhukta hai |\n| **Declination** | Geographic north aur magnetic north ke beech ka kon (angle) | Kisi jagah par 3° |\n| **Dip** | Prithvi ke field ka zameen ke saath jhukaav; sirf naam jaan lo | Compass ka jhuka hua needle |\n| **Magnetic shielding** | Kisi cheez ko bahar ke magnetic field se bachana | Naram lohe ka chhalla (ring) |",
