            "headingHinglish": "Part C: Compass se field ki lines banana",
            "body": "Bina iron filings ke bhi field line bana sakte hain, ek chhote compass ki madad se.\n\n**Kadam:**\n1. Kaagaz par bar magnet rakho (N ek taraf, S doosri taraf) aur uske kinaare pencil se mark karo.\n2. Chhota compass magnet ke N pole ke paas rakho. Needle ke **dono sire** par pencil se do dot lagao.\n3. Compass ko uthao aur is tarah rakho ki uski needle ka **S sira** pichhle dot par aa jaye. Phir needle ke naye sire par dot lagao.\n4. Ye dohrate raho jab tak compass magnet ke S pole tak na pahunch jaye.\n5. Sab dots ko smooth curve se jodo: ye **ek field line** hai. Compass needle ka N sira jis taraf point karta tha, wahi arrow ki disha hai (N se S ki taraf).\n6. Naye shuruaati dot se aur lines banao.\n\n```\n                 o   o   o   o\n             o                   o\n          o                         o\n         o                           o\n        ^                             v\n      [N═════════════════════════════S]\n```\n\n> **Figure 2.7** – Compass se banayi gayi field line: har \"o\" pencil ka ek dot hai; dots jodne par N se S tak curved line milti hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Bina iron filings ke bhi field line bana sakte hain, ek chhote compass ki madad se.\n\n**Kadam:**\n1. Kaagaz par bar magnet rakho (N ek taraf, S doosri taraf) aur uske kinaare pencil se mark karo.\n2. Chhota compass magnet ke N pole ke paas rakho. Needle ke **dono sire** par pencil se do dot lagao.\n3. Compass ko uthao aur is tarah rakho ki uski needle ka **S sira** pichhle dot par aa jaye. Phir needle ke naye sire par dot lagao.\n4. Ye dohrate raho jab tak compass magnet ke S pole tak na pahunch jaye.\n5. Sab dots ko smooth curve se jodo: ye **ek field line** hai. Compass needle ka N sira jis taraf point karta tha, wahi arrow ki disha hai (N se S ki taraf).\n6. Naye shuruaati dot se aur lines banao.\n\n```\n                 o   o   o   o\n             o                   o\n          o                         o\n         o                           o\n        ^                             v\n      [N═════════════════════════════S]\n```\n\n> **Figure 2.7** – Compass se banayi gayi field line: har \"o\" pencil ka ek dot hai; dots jodne par N se S tak curved line milti hai."
