            "headingHinglish": "School lab ki ek sui aur ek gira hua magnet",
            "body": "School ki physics lab mein Ms. Pradhan ne Rajveer ko ek steel ki silai wali sui (sewing needle) di aur boli, \"Pehle isse chhote pins ke paas le jao. Dekho kya hota hai.\"\n\nRajveer ne sui pins ke paas rakhi. Ek bhi pin nahi uthi. \"Ma'am, ye to sirf ek sadharan sui hai.\"\n\nMs. Pradhan ne ek bar magnet uthaya. \"Ab is magnet ke **ek hi sire (N pole)** se sui ko ek end se doosre end tak ek hi disha mein ragdo. Har baar magnet ko sui se door utha kar wapas shuru wale end par laao. Aise kam se kam 30-40 baar karo.\"\n\nRajveer ne dhairya se wahi kiya. Phir jab usne sui pins ke paas rakhi, to **sui ne kai chhote pins utha liye.** Wo chakit reh gaya.\n\nUsi lab mein ek purana magnet pada tha, jo Rajveer se pichhle hafte kai baar gir chuka tha, aur ek din heater ke paas bhi bhool gaya tha. Ms. Pradhan ne hasi mein kaha, \"Is magnet se bhi pins uthao.\" Pehle ye magnet 15 pins uthata tha. Ab usne bas 4 pins uthaye.\n\nRajveer ne soch kar poochha, \"Ma'am, sui mein magnetism **kahan se aayi**? Aur is purane magnet ki magnetism **kahan chali gayi**?\" Ye dono sawal hum topic ke beech mein solve karenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "School ki physics lab mein Ms. Pradhan ne Rajveer ko ek steel ki silai wali sui (sewing needle) di aur boli, \"Pehle isse chhote pins ke paas le jao. Dekho kya hota hai.\"\n\nRajveer ne sui pins ke paas rakhi. Ek bhi pin nahi uthi. \"Ma'am, ye to sirf ek sadharan sui hai.\"\n\nMs. Pradhan ne ek bar magnet uthaya. \"Ab is magnet ke **ek hi sire (N pole)** se sui ko ek end se doosre end tak ek hi disha mein ragdo. Har baar magnet ko sui se door utha kar wapas shuru wale end par laao. Aise kam se kam 30-40 baar karo.\"\n\nRajveer ne dhairya se wahi kiya. Phir jab usne sui pins ke paas rakhi, to **sui ne kai chhote pins utha liye.** Wo chakit reh gaya.\n\nUsi lab mein ek purana magnet pada tha, jo Rajveer se pichhle hafte kai baar gir chuka tha, aur ek din heater ke paas bhi bhool gaya tha. Ms. Pradhan ne hasi mein kaha, \"Is magnet se bhi pins uthao.\" Pehle ye magnet 15 pins uthata tha. Ab usne bas 4 pins uthaye.\n\nRajveer ne soch kar poochha, \"Ma'am, sui mein magnetism **kahan se aayi**? Aur is purane magnet ki magnetism **kahan chali gayi**?\" Ye dono sawal hum topic ke beech mein solve karenge."
