            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Pichhle topic mein humne dekha ki magnetism ek magnet se aati hai, aur use banaya, kamzor kiya aur khatam bhi kiya ja sakta hai. Us topic ke end mein ek bada sawal chhoda tha: **kya bina kisi magnet ke bhi magnetism paida ho sakti hai?** Is topic mein hum dekhenge ki haan: sirf ek **bahta hua current** bhi apne aas-paas magnetic field bana deta hai. Yaani ab magnetism ka source ek magnet nahi, ek taar hai jisme bijli beh rahi hai. Is topic mein hum ye bhi seekhenge ki current ki direction se field ki direction kaise pata karte hain, aur taar ko lapet kar ek aisa coil (solenoid) kaise banta hai jo bilkul bar magnet jaisa kaam karta hai.",
