            "body": "Ek bade kabadkhane (scrapyard) mein Mr. Bhullar crane chalate the. Crane ke hook par ek bada gol, kala sa \"magnet\" latka tha. Unka chhota padosi Daksh ek din chhutti mein unke saath aa gaya aur door khade hokar dekhne laga.\n\nMr. Bhullar ne switch dabaya. Magnet neeche gaya, purani car ke dhaanchon (car bodies) ke dher par tika, aur jab upar utha to poora dher, kai purani gaadiyon ke dhaanche, uske saath chipak kar hawa mein utha gaya. Crane ghoomi, truck ke upar pahunchi, aur Mr. Bhullar ne switch dobara dabaya. **Chhapaak!** Saara dher ek saath truck mein gir pada.\n\nDaksh hairaan reh gaya. \"Uncle, ye to magnet hai na? Magnet ka to kaam hai chipakna. Ye kabhi chipakta hai aur kabhi chhod deta hai? Ek aam magnet ko to maine kabhi 'chhodte' nahi dekha!\"\n\nMr. Bhullar muskuraye, \"Ye aam magnet hai hi nahi, beta. Ye bijli se chalne wala magnet hai. Isko banane ka tareeka tum abhi mere saath seekh lo, phir tumhara sawal khud solve ho jayega.\" Is kahani ko hum topic ke aakhir mein solve karenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ek bade kabadkhane (scrapyard) mein Mr. Bhullar crane chalate the. Crane ke hook par ek bada gol, kala sa \"magnet\" latka tha. Unka chhota padosi Daksh ek din chhutti mein unke saath aa gaya aur door khade hokar dekhne laga.\n\nMr. Bhullar ne switch dabaya. Magnet neeche gaya, purani car ke dhaanchon (car bodies) ke dher par tika, aur jab upar utha to poora dher, kai purani gaadiyon ke dhaanche, uske saath chipak kar hawa mein utha gaya. Crane ghoomi, truck ke upar pahunchi, aur Mr. Bhullar ne switch dobara dabaya. **Chhapaak!** Saara dher ek saath truck mein gir pada.\n\nDaksh hairaan reh gaya. \"Uncle, ye to magnet hai na? Magnet ka to kaam hai chipakna. Ye kabhi chipakta hai aur kabhi chhod deta hai? Ek aam magnet ko to maine kabhi 'chhodte' nahi dekha!\"\n\nMr. Bhullar muskuraye, \"Ye aam magnet hai hi nahi, beta. Ye bijli se chalne wala magnet hai. Isko banane ka tareeka tum abhi mere saath seekh lo, phir tumhara sawal khud solve ho jayega.\" Is kahani ko hum topic ke aakhir mein solve karenge."
