            "body": "Daksh ne dobara poocha, \"Par uncle, magnet chhod kaise deta hai?\"\n\nMr. Bhullar ne samjhaya, \"Crane ka magnet ek bada coil hai jis ke andar soft iron ka core hai. **Switch dabaya: current chalta hai, core magnet ban jaata hai** aur lohe ke dher ko pakad leta hai. **Switch dobara dabaya: current band, core ka magnetism lagbhag khatam**, to dher apne bhaar (weight) se neeche gir jaata hai.\"\n\nDaksh bola, \"To isliye ye aam magnet nahi, ye to 'jab marzi ho, tab' wala magnet hai!\"\n\n\"Bilkul. Aur isme **steel nahi, soft iron** lagta hai, warna current band karne par bhi magnetism rehta aur dher kabhi nahi girta. Ek car ke dhaanche (800 kg) ka weight hi 8000 N hai, aur jab dher uthta hai tab magnet ko usse bhi zyada bal chahiye.\" Daksh ne dher ko truck mein girte hue dekha aur taali baja di.\n\n(Topic 1 mein Mr. Barua ke kabaadi yard ka crane magnet bhi asal mein aisa hi electromagnet tha. Tab humne sirf ye dekha tha ki wo kya uthata hai; ab ye bhi pata hai ki wo dher ko chhodta kaise hai.)",
