            "body": "Pichle topic mein humne dekha ki jab taar mein current behta hai to uske aas paas magnetic field ban jaati hai, aur soft iron ke core par taar lapetkar electromagnet banta hai jo crane mein bhaari lohe ko uthata hai aur bell mein hathoda chalata hai. Topic 4 ki Oersted wali baat ([magnetism-part4.md](magnetism-part4.md)) yahi thi: **current se magnetism**. Topic 5 ke end mein ek ulta sawaal chhoda tha: agar current se magnetism ban sakta hai, to **kya magnetism se current ban sakta hai?**\n\nIs topic mein hum is sawaal ka jawab dhoondhenge. Jawab \"haan\" hai, par ek shart ke saath, aur isi shart se bijli-ghar, cycle ki dynamo wali light aur ghar ka pankha, sab samajh aa jaate hain. Ye Magnetism chapter ka aakhri topic hai, aur Class 9 Physics ka bhi. To end mein chapter ka wrap-up aur poore Class 9 Physics ka ek chhota sa closing bhi hoga.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pichle topic mein humne dekha ki jab taar mein current behta hai to uske aas paas magnetic field ban jaati hai, aur soft iron ke core par taar lapetkar electromagnet banta hai jo crane mein bhaari lohe ko uthata hai aur bell mein hathoda chalata hai. Topic 4 ki Oersted wali baat ([magnetism-part4.md](magnetism-part4.md)) yahi thi: **current se magnetism**. Topic 5 ke end mein ek ulta sawaal chhoda tha: agar current se magnetism ban sakta hai, to **kya magnetism se current ban sakta hai?**\n\nIs topic mein hum is sawaal ka jawab dhoondhenge. Jawab \"haan\" hai, par ek shart ke saath, aur isi shart se bijli-ghar, cycle ki dynamo wali light aur ghar ka pankha, sab samajh aa jaate hain. Ye Magnetism chapter ka aakhri topic hai, aur Class 9 Physics ka bhi. To end mein chapter ka wrap-up aur poore Class 9 Physics ka ek chhota sa closing bhi hoga."
