            "heading": "Class 9 Physics ka closing",
            "headingHinglish": "Class 9 Physics ka closing",
            "body": "Aaj hum Class 9 Physics ke aakhri chapter tak pahunch gaye. Ek nazar mein poora safar:\n\n| Chapter | Is chapter ne humein kya diya |\n|---|---|\n| 1. Measurement aur Units | Cheezon ko sahi naapna aur unit ke saath likhna |\n| 2. Motion | Cheez kaise chalti hai: distance, speed, velocity, acceleration |\n| 3. Force aur Laws of Motion | Cheezein kyun chalti hain: force aur Newton ke teen niyam |\n| 4. Gravitation | Cheezein neeche kyun girti hain, mass aur weight, aur satellites kaise ghoomte hain |\n| 5. Pressure aur Fluids | Liquids aur gases ka dabaav, floating aur sinking |\n| 6. Work, Energy aur Power | Kaam, energy ke roop aur uska badalna |\n| 7. Machines | Lever, pulley jaisi machines se kaam aasaan karna |\n| 8. Heat aur Temperature | Garmi kya hai, kaise naapi jaati aur kaise phailti hai |\n| 9. Sound | Awaaz kaise banti hai aur kaise chalti hai |\n| 10. Light: Reflection | Roshni ka seedha chalna aur sheeshon se lautna |\n| 11. Light: Refraction | Roshni ka ek medium se doosre mein jaakar mudna, lens |\n| 12. Electricity | Current, voltage, resistance aur circuits |\n| 13. Magnetism | Magnet, field, electromagnet aur electromagnetic induction |\n\nIs poore safar mein ek baat baar baar dikhi: **energy ek roop se doosre roop mein badalti hai, par kabhi banti ya khatam nahi hoti**: girta paani bijli ban jaata hai, bijli ghoomna ban jaati hai, ghoomna phir bijli ban jaata hai.\n\nAap Physics ke aakhri chapter tak aa pahunche, aur ye chhoti baat nahi hai. Jo aapne seekha hai, usse aap apne aas paas ki duniya ko samajh sakte ho: cycle ki light se lekar bijli-ghar tak. Sawaal poochte rehna, kyunki Physics sawalon se hi shuru hoti hai. Aapko dher saari shubhkaamnayein!",
